07ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"90228ad7fbdc5179\" href=\"?note=90228ad7fbdc5179\" title=\"17-df-definable-set\">17-df-definable-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"local n-ary and restricted-parameter extension of compared unary definitions"},{"key":"source_verification_history","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed</span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.4; 4.3"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Exercise 1.4.17(ii); Exercise 4.3.21, unary parameter definability"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>48</span><span>259</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>64</span><span>275</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_date","html":"2026-10-13"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-1.6.2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>（语言，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq|\\mathfrak{A}|\">\\(B\\subseteq|\\mathfrak{A}|\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；对每个所用的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\omega\">\\(m\\in\\omega\\)</span>，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i=v_i\">\\(x_i=v_i\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>）和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_j=v_{n+j}\">\\(y_j=v_{n+j}\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;m\">\\(j&lt;m\\)</span>），见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeVar}\\)</span> (free-variable operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span> (assignments, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_L\\)</span> (satisfaction, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_n(\\mathfrak{A};B)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(|\\mathfrak A|^n)\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}_n(\\mathfrak{A};B)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(|\\mathfrak A|^n)\\)</span>（集合，以下定义）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Def}_n(\\mathfrak{A};B)\n=\\bigl\\{X\\subseteq|\\mathfrak{A}|^n:\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\;\\exists\\bar b\\in B^m\\;&amp;\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\n\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1},y_0,\\ldots,y_{m-1}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak{A}|^n\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\bar a\\in X\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\,\n\\bigl(\n(\\forall i&lt;n\\;s(x_i)=\\bar a(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{44mm}\\land\n(\\forall j&lt;m\\;s(y_j)=\\bar b(j))\n\\to\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\varphi)\n\\bigr)\n\\bigr)\n\\bigr]\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Def}_n(\\mathfrak{A};B)\n=\\bigl\\{X\\subseteq|\\mathfrak{A}|^n:\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\;\\exists\\bar b\\in B^m\\;&amp;\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\n\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1},y_0,\\ldots,y_{m-1}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak{A}|^n\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\bar a\\in X\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\,\n\\bigl(\n(\\forall i&lt;n\\;s(x_i)=\\bar a(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{44mm}\\land\n(\\forall j&lt;m\\;s(y_j)=\\bar b(j))\n\\to\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\varphi)\n\\bigr)\n\\bigr)\n\\bigr]\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>参数元组是有限的，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span>；因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\varnothing\">\\(B=\\varnothing\\)</span> 时得到参数自由可定义集。两块变量互异已作为正式约定写入 Hypothesis，赋值扩张条件不再依赖 Remark。</p>\n<p>原书 Exercise 4.3.21（p.259，DjVu275）对一元集合使用来自整个载体的有限参数元组；Exercise 1.4.17(ii)（p.48，DjVu64）有同样定义。本地允许一般 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 并将参数限制在指定集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，因此仅对应其机制，不能标作原书同编号定义。所有匹配有限坐标的赋值均存在，因为变量互异且载体非空。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"58507ea1921a657e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9b641c11eab6e875","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-definable-set","status":"resolved","id":"902